    "detailed_description": "This game contains 6 popular sports: soccer, volleyball, dodgeball, kickball, tennis, and golf!<br />\r\nBut there's a unqiue twist: in Big Ball Sports, the ball is bigger than you!<br />\r\nThis oversized ball offers players unpredictable and wild moments, making gameplay even more fun and challenging! <br />\r\nRegular rules taking on new meanings as you test your sports skills in games sure to bring smiles and excitement!<br />\r\nIt's a sports party game that offers easy controls and big fun for everyone!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn Big Ball Sports, enjoy the following 6 sports:<br />\r\n\u3010Soccer\u3011<br />\r\nAim for your opponent's goal with a gigantic soccer ball and make a miraculous score!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Volleyball\u3011<br />\r\nExperience the fun and thrill of volleyball by sending a large ball flying over the net to your opponent.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Dodgeball\u3011<br />\r\nThrow a large ball at your opponents and engage in action-packed dodgeball battles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Kickball\u3011<br />\r\nA fusion of baseball and soccer, enjoy a new sports experience kicking a big ball.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Tennis\u3011<br />\r\nFeel the tension of tennis as you challenge your opponent with a large tennis ball.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Golf\u3011<br />\r\nDrive a big golf ball onto the course, aiming for a hole-in-one. The challenge of golf awaits!",
